WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.340
Meet ComputeDeck.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.400
See your clusters and cloud GPUs in one place.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Open a queued job to understand the wait.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Then choose your GPU needs

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.900
and compare capacity, permissions, and time limits.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.200
Read-only by default, with your existing SSH setup.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.200
This walkthrough uses example data.
